<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1a1a1a; line-height: 1.5;">
    <p>Your Super Admin account for {{ app_name }} has been created.</p>

    <p>
      Before accessing the dashboard, you must complete your mandatory
      multi-factor authentication (MFA) setup.
    </p>

    <p>
      <a href="{{ setup_url }}"
         style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; background: #1d4ed8;
                color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 4px;">
        Complete MFA setup
      </a>
    </p>

    <p>
      If the button does not work, copy this link into your browser:<br>
      <a href="{{ setup_url }}">{{ setup_url }}</a>
    </p>

    <p>
      This link expires in {{ expires_in_minutes }} minutes and was sent to
      {{ recipient_email }}.
    </p>

    <p>If you did not expect this account creation, contact your system administrator.</p>
  </body>
</html>